codex
The math stack lacks a bivariate CDF, so a clean full-covariance Gaussian pass would require a custom approximation. I’m trying a cheaper control variate instead: at the final preactivation only, blend the direct sample ReLU mean with the Gaussian ReLU moment computed from that sample’s own mean and variance.
